SUMMARY:Trail Talks with TLC: Old Creedmoor
DESCRIPTION:Aerial view of Old Creedmoor Preserve by Emilia Brennan \nGet a special look at TLC's work on this staff led hike series!\nJoin TLC Associate Land Manager\, Umar Muhammad on an exploration of our newest Wake County nature preserve! Along the 2-mile route\, Umar will point out the various tree species at Old Creedmoor Nature Preserve\, which protects 65 acres of pristine forest habitat and critical streams! Old Creedmoor's trails are built for mountain biking in mind\, so there is variable terrain with potential tripping hazards and other features that can pose difficulty for some participants.  This is a free event\, but preregistration is required.\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nInclement Weather Policy: In the event of inclement weather\, you will be contacted by email for a call on cancellation or postponement.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/trail-talks-with-tlc-old-creedmoor
LOCATION:Old Creedmoor Nature Preserve\, 13509 Old Creedmoor Rd\, Wake Forest\, NC\, 27587\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
