SUMMARY:Nature Storytime: Curious Crawlers
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a bug-tastic Nature Storytime! \nEnter the teeny tiny world of insects and learn what makes them so special! Come learn about our creeping\, crawling\, fluttering friends with nature stories\, nature games\, and a short ramble through the forest. Join us at the Brumley Nature Playspace for this monthly story series where you can meet other families in your community and learn about nature. This month's stories are: An Extraordinary Ordinary Moth by Karlin Gray and Butterflies are Pretty Gross by Rosemary Mosco. This program is designed for kids age 3-7 and their grownups. This is a free event\, but please register all members of the family attending\, including children and adults: 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/nature-storytime-curious-crawlers
LOCATION:Brumley South Nature Preserve\, 3055 New Hope Church Rd\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
END:VEVENT
