SUMMARY:Meet Your Plant Neighbors
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for an exploration of plants at Brumley North Nature Preserve!\nWhich plants do we live amongst? What are their names? What are their stories? On this hike\, we'll amble through the different plant communities of Brumley North\, identifying trees\, shrubs\, and herbs along the way. All levels of plant knowledge are welcome -- we are a community of learners and sharers! This is a free event\, but preregistration is required.\n\n \n \nIf registration is full\, please fill out the waitlist form here by August 26th at noon.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/meet-your-plant-neighbors-2
LOCATION:Brumley North Nature Preserve\, 3620 Old State Highway 10\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
