SUMMARY:Nature Storytime: Me Oh My! The Dragonfly!
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for a dragonfly journey at Nature Storytime!  \nLearn about our flying\, sparkling\, ferocious friend\, the dragonfly! This month’s story time will invite everyone to learn about the lifecycle and habitat of dragonflies with nature stories\, nature games\, and a short ramble down to the pond. Join us at Williamson Nature Preserve for this monthly story series where you can meet other families in your community and learn about nature. This month's stories are: Soar High\, Dragonfly! by Sheri Mabry Bestor and Eliza and the Dragonfly by Susie Caldwell Rinehart. This program is designed for kids age 3-7 and their grownups. Please register all members of the family attending\, including children and adults: \n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please Meera Butalia at mbutalia@triangleland.org to be added to the waitlist.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/nature-storytime-me-oh-my-the-dragonfly
LOCATION:Williamson Farm and Nature Preserve\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, 27610\, United States
END:VEVENT
